# Strictly monotonic ontology evolution DRIVER gate (ADR-0010 re-bird): the
# positive image of the SOVEREIGN multi-party law. The offender form -- a
# SOVEREIGN order whose sovereign-lease evidence links fewer than 2 distinct
# sj:LeaseSignature records -- is the inverted companion
# verify/066_monotonic_evolution.unbound.rq (zero-rows-pass,
# offender-reporting per ADR-0010:
# docs/architecture/adr/0010-gate-convention-directory-is-convention.md),
# verbatim former gates/066. The driver witnesses the authority-requirement
# projection the law constrains: one row per order carrying its
# sj:authorityRequirement.
PREFIX sj: <https://ggen-igniter.dev/ontology/semantic-jira#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?order ?requirement WHERE {
  ?order a sj:WorkOrder ;
         sj:authorityRequirement ?requirement .
}
ORDER BY ?order
